[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Schema + binder (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mDeclarative rule schema, pure validate(), generic bindForm(). Most reuse; commits to a schema format.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Per-form validators
     [38;5;246mShared predicate library, each form writes its own validate function. Nothing frozen; shallower reuse.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: Native HTML5 constraints
     [38;5;246mConstraints in markup, thin shared renderer. Least code; weak on cross-field rules and unit testing.[39m
